= Gaurav Sinha

~~~
{}{img_left}{Gaurav.jpg}{Gaurav Sinha}{175px}{225px}{IMGLINKTARGET}
== About Me
I am a Principal Research Manager at [https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/ Microsoft Research]. Prior to this, I was a Senior Research Scientist at Adobe Research (2018-2022) and an Applied Scientist at Microsoft Ads (2016-2018).
I received my Ph.D. in Mathematics from the [https://www.caltech.edu/ California Institute of Technology] in 2016, where I was advised by Prof. [http://www.math.caltech.edu/people/rains.html Eric Rains], and my Integrated M.Sc. in Mathematics and Scientific Computing from [https://www.iitk.ac.in/ Indian Institute of Technology (IIT) Kanpur] in 2011.
My Ph.D. research focused on theoretical problems in mathematics and computer science. Since moving to industry, I have focused on developing principled solutions to industrial research problems, combining theory and applied research to deliver practical impact.
I can be reached via email at sinhagaur88 AT gmail(dot)com.
~~~

== Research Interests
- Fine Tuning and Alignment of Language Models (LMs)
- Reinforcement Learning (RL) Theory and Applications (currently focussing on RL fine-tuning of LMs)
- Generative Information Retrieval
- Causal Machine Learning

